Bind Npc 31568 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31567 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 772 "[Lemegeton] Scroll of Seal"
    Journal for karus "You must collect the materials that the [Leader of Order of the Sorcery] Malraseu needs."
    Journal for elmorad "You must collect the materials that the [Leader of Order of the Sorcery] Pelore needs."
    Collect 1 of 900291000
    Collect 1 of 900292000
    Collect 1 of 900293000

Requires player level >= 75 and quest 771 is completed

Rewards
    Give 500000 experience
    Give 50000 coins
    Give 1 of 900294000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "That's weird. Didn't bros say that Malraseu will tell us about it? But Monk Malraseu has no idea."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "That's weird. Didn't Seis say that Pelore will tell us about it? But Pelore has no idea."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "[Order of the Sorcery] Bros will teach you isolation? I haven't heard about that."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "First, we need materials to make the [Scroll of Seal]. Obtain [Hidden Sealed Scroll] from [Unidentified Old Man] in Moradon. Then, collect [Unopenable Lock] from [Heppa's Disciple] Shojin in Moradon, and [Magic Power Point of Krowaz Territory] from [White Shadow] Chacer, in Krowaz territory. Come back once you've finished collecting all the materials.\n\nCollect [Hidden Sealed Scroll] from [Unidentified Old Man] of Moradon, [Lock cannot be open] from [Disciple of Hepa] Shozin of Moradon, and [Magic Power Point of Krowaz Territory] from [White Shadow] Chaser in Krowaz territory, and deliver them to the [Order of the Sorcery Leader] Malraseu of Eslant."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Seis will teach isolation? I haven't heard of that."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "First, we need materials to make the [Scroll of Seal]. Obtain [Hidden Sealed Scroll] from [Unidentified Old Man] in Moradon. Then, collect [Unopenable Lock] from [Heppa's Disciple] Shojin in Moradon, and [Magic Power Point of Krowaz Territory] from [White Shadow] Chacer, in Ronark Land. Come back once you've finished collecting all the materials.\n\nCollect [Hidden Sealed Scroll] from [Unidentified Old Man] of Moradon, [Lock cannot be open] from [Disciple of Hepa] Shozin of Moradon, and [Magic Power Point of Krowaz Territory] from [White Shadow] Chaser in Krowaz territory, and deliver them to the [Order of the Sorcery Leader] Pelore of Eslant."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "You haven't collected them all, yet. Let me tell you one more time. You have to collect [Hidden Sealed Scroll] from [Unidentified Old Man] in Moradon, [Unopenable Lock] from [Heppa's Disciple] Shojin in Moradon, and [Magic Power Point of Krowaz Territory] from [White Shadow] Chacer, in Krowaz territory."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You haven't collected them all, yet. Let me tell you one more time. You have to collect [Hidden Sealed Scroll] from [Unidentified Old Man] in Moradon, [Unopenable Lock] from [Heppa's Disciple] Shojin in Moradon, and [Magic Power Point of Krowaz Territory] from [White Shadow] Chacer, in Ronark Land"

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "You brought them all!\n\nHere, with [Completed Sealed Document] bring it to Bros. I feel something bad is going to happen."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "You brought them all!\n\nHere, with [Completed Sealed Document] bring it to Seis. I feel something bad is going to happen."
